er 10.3.183.5之前版本（Windows/Mac OS X/Linux/Solaris）及10.3.186.3之前版本（Android）存在内存破坏漏洞。攻击者可通过构造特制的MP4文件（利用SequenceParameterSetNALUnit）诱导用户打开，触发内存破坏，导致远程代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响范围广泛，CVSS评分10.0，危害严重。Adobe已在2011年8月安全公告中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2140"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-08-10T22:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:30:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.5 及以上版本（Windows/Mac/Linux/Solaris）或 10.3.186.3 及以上版本（Android）；Adobe AIR 升级至 2.7.1 及以上版本。由于 Flash Player 已停止维护，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并迁移至 HTML5 标准。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00007.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00008.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48308","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-21.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1144.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA11-222A.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14074","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18437","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2140.json","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/73a0914c4ac1d4c01919fb3b7dc1260c72ad6122/modules/exploits/windows/browser/adobe_flash_sps.rb","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2140","https://github.com/CCrashBandicot/helpful/blob/336b2c95b482d6c9de7756109b2699c7cfd8545c/CVE-2011-2140.py","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2140","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2140","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/