h Player 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 SWF 文件或嵌入恶意 Flash 内容的网页触发该漏洞，造成缓冲区溢出并执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Solaris 平台上版本低于 10.3.183.5 的 Adobe Flash Player，以及 Android 平台版本低于 10.3.186.3 的 Adobe Flash Player，同时影响 Windows/Mac OS X 平台版本低于 2.7.1 的 Adobe AIR。由于该漏洞无需认证且攻击复杂度低，攻击者只需诱使用户访问恶意页面即可实现远程代码执行，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2130"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-08-10T21:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:30:45Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.5 及以上版本（Windows/Mac/Linux/Solaris），Android 平台升级至 10.3.186.3 及以上版本，Adobe AIR 升级至 2.7.1 及以上版本。官方补丁见 APSB11-21 安全公告。鉴于 Adobe Flash Player 已于 2020 年底停止支持并终止生命周期，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 以消除所有历史漏洞风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00007.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00008.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48308","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-21.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1144.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA11-222A.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14194","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16210","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2130.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2130","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2130","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2130","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2130","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2130.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2130.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2130","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0ccbe74701d72e8d7117a09b2db369605fa0bae6/2011/CVE-2011-2130.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2130.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0075.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0008","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2780","title":"Chyrp 2.x gz.php 文件参数目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Chyrp 2.0 及更早版本的 includes/lib/gz.php 文件存在目录遍历漏洞。该脚本在处理 file 参数时未对用户输入进行充分过滤与校验，导致远程攻击者可在参数中插入\"..\"(点号点号)序列跳出网站根目录限制。攻击者在无需身份认证的情况下，仅需向目标服务器发送包含恶意路径的 HTTP 请求，即可读取服务器上的任意文件，如配置文件、源代码或敏感系统文件等，进而造成信息泄露。该漏洞影响所有运行 Chyrp 2.0 及之前版本且未打补丁的站点，利用方式简单，仅需构造包含目录遍历序列的 URL 即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2780"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-07-19T21:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:59Z","remediation":"建议升级 Chyrp 至 2.1 及以上版本（官方已修复该目录遍历漏洞），或手动修复 includes/lib/gz.php 中的 file 参数过滤逻辑，增加路径规范化与目录遍历防护（如使用 realpath 验证路径是否在允许目录内）。临时缓解可在 Web 服务器层面配置规则拦截包含 ../ 的 file 参数请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/73891","http://secunia.com/advisories/45184","http://securityreason.com/securityalert/8312","http://www.justanotherhacker.com/advisories/JAHx113.txt","http://www.ocert.org/advisories/ocert-2011-001.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2011/07/13/5","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2011/07/13/6","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/518890/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/48672","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/68565","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35946","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-2780.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-2780.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-2780.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-2780.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2011-2780-2052.yaml","https://github.com/1in9e/gosint/blob/bdda4461515c4398c08638676bbbfe451b73ff95/client/vuln_scan/nuclei/tools/nuclei-templates/cves/2011/CVE-2011-2780.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2011-2780_20.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/cve-2011-2780-2052.yaml","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3ba1ba47-d8dd-4841-8204-dcde71faa6c8.json","https://github.com/0xelixer/new/blob/6f6dd4a43a76ce74c1e8cc0558629a2ea198286e/nuclei-temps/Vulnerability-Templates/template2/cve-2011-2780-2056.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bb01f7bb9f9641b9b1c18c8bce69c7bfeef56677/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-v4h8-98x3-fcrp/GHSA-v4h8-98x3-fcrp.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0007","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2744","title":"Chyrp Chyrp 2.0/2.1 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Chyrp 2.1 及更早版本（含 2.0）在默认 URI 的请求处理中存在目录遍历（CWE-22）漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需在请求默认 URI 时于 action 参数中构造并传入经 URL 编码的 `..%2F`（即编码后的点点斜杠）序列，即可突破程序预期的路径限制，使应用程序包含并执行服务器上的任意本地文件。该漏洞属于典型的本地文件包含（LFI）类问题，攻击者借此可读取到本不应暴露的敏感文件（如配置文件、源码等），进而可能获取系统凭据或进一步推进攻击。其触发条件简单，仅需向目标站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级为中高危，主要影响部署了相关版本 Chyrp 博客系统的 Web 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2744"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-07-19T20:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:54Z","remediation":"升级 Chyrp 到官方修复版本（2.1 之后的 2.x 版本，建议查阅项目仓库获取含路径遍历修复的提交）；若无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）配置中拦截向默认 URI 传入含 ..%2F 编码序列的 action 参数请求，并限制 PHP 仅可包含白名单目录内文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/73890","http://secunia.com/advisories/45184","http://securityreason.com/securityalert/8312","http://www.justanotherhacker.com/advisories/JAHx113.txt","http://www.ocert.org/advisories/ocert-2011-001.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2011/07/13/5","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2011/07/13/6","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/518890/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/48672","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/68564","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35945","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-2744.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-2744.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-2744.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-2744.js","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2011-2780.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8b3d6ccb0f4e9e36a888697a7de582054e8c5bc9/2011/CVE-2011-2744.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2011/CVE-2011-2744.md","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2011-2744-2047.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2011-2744-2048.yaml","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2011/CVE-2011-2780.md","https://github.com/Ciyfly/woodpecker/blob/f88bed6da55238547a423ce17dccb2cdbc93be50/pocs/nuclei/cves/2011/CVE-2011-2744.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0120","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0120.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2465","title":"ISC BIND 9 RPZ 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 9.8.x 版本在启用递归查询并配置响应策略区域（RPZ）包含 DNAME 或特定 CNAME 记录时，存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可发送特制 DNS 查询请求，触发 named 守护进程崩溃，导致 DNS 服务中断。影响范围为 BIND 9.8.0、9.8.0-P1、9.8.0-P2 和 9.8.1b1 版本，攻击条件要求目标服务器同时开启递归功能并部署 RPZ 策略。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 2.6（低危），ISC 已在 9.8.0-P3 版本中修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2465"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-08T20:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:23Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 ISC BIND 至 9.8.0-P3 或更高版本（如 9.8.1-P1、9.9.0 等），可从 ISC 官网下载补丁包。若暂时无法升级，可通过修改 named.conf 禁用递归查询（设置 recursion no;）或移除 Response Policy Zones (RPZ) 配置（删除 response-policy 语句）作为临时缓解措施。同时建议在防火墙层面限制 DNS 服务仅对受信网段开放，减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-July/062522.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-07/msg00002.html","http://osvdb.org/73604","http://secunia.com/advisories/45185","http://www.isc.org/software/bind/advisories/cve-2011-2465","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/137968","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/518750/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/48565","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1025743","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/68374","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2465.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2465.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2465","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2465.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2465.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-24xx/CVE-2011-2465.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2465","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9e840c51f12aff4a18b8c50d63ae898b6e33f403/references/CVE-2011-2465-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2465","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2011/CVE-2011-2465.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0120.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0140","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0140.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2627","title":"Opera Web Browser DOM 实现远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera浏览器11.50之前的版本中，DOM实现存在未指定的漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意内容的网页（如live.com示例），触发浏览器DOM处理异常，导致应用程序崩溃并造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击者只需诱导受害者访问特制网页即可触发，影响所有使用受影响版本Opera浏览器的用户。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2627"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:40Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Opera 浏览器升级至 11.50 或更高版本，该版本已修复 DOM 实现中的拒绝服务漏洞。升级方式：通过 Opera 菜单栏选择「帮助」>「检查更新」自动更新，或访问 opera.com/download 下载 11.50+ 完整安装包，Windows、Mac 及 Linux 平台均有对应版本。如短期内无法升级，应避免访问不可信来源的网页，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施，限制对受损 DOM 处理的触发路径，降低崩溃风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/89175b2ce75a8c340e9d987615810a87444e6d01/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2627.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2627","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a14b63e8afc2a58338f509c08078b69c0cfe7fee/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2627.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2627.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2627.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2627.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2627.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2627.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/89eeaa8d7ef6ae24cbc356832e183d8519afcdb0/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2627.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c0fd4753f7ac9b585b3d8bb24ab1298b333e02ca/2011/CVE-2011-2627.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0140.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0140.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0139","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0139.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2626","title":"Opera 浏览器 iframe 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Opera 浏览器在 11.50 版本之前存在资源管理缺陷。当攻击者通过注入脚本设置 IFRAME 元素的 SRC 属性时，浏览器未能正确处理该请求，导致应用程序崩溃并造成拒绝服务。同时，浏览器在生成错误页面时存在缺陷，若连续请求无效 URL，最终会导致主机磁盘空间被占满、浏览器崩溃且错误文件被遗留。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程触发该漏洞，影响 Opera 浏览器 11.49 及之前版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2626"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:40Z","remediation":"立即将 Opera 浏览器升级至 11.50 或更高版本，该版本已修复 IFRAME 元素 SRC 属性注入导致的拒绝服务漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 或限制 IFRAME 加载作为临时缓解措施，同时避免访问不可信网页以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6d13b43de313698fc7b472535f6d74902fcb6edb/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2626.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2626","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9fbc3eab0f67f21cdc1f59fce6ae94d3ff015719/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2626.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2626.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2626.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2626.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2626.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2626.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4cd7841d39f8c59056b450c5339511feb54f9bc6/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2626.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2011/2xx